<newsitem itemid="387483" id="root" date="1997-02-19" xml:lang="en">
<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Delta raises yr headline shr, div.</title>
<headline>Delta raises yr headline shr, div.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended Dec 27, 1996</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr, headline (cts)	99.3	vs    85.4</p>
<p>    Shr (cts)		   117.6	vs    90.0</p>
<p>    Div (cts)		    39.5	vs    34.0</p>
<p>    Attrib income	     51.95	vs    40.26</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		     78.83	vs    65.59</p>
<p>    Tax			   23.65	vs    24.37</p>
<p>    Interest recieved	  6.12	vs    0.05 paid</p>
<p>    Turnover		   562.73	vs    483.58</p>
<p>    Share of associates'     3.24	vs    2.23</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  6.16	vs    2.43</p>
<p>Div payable April 4</p>
<p>on register March 7</p>
<p>Full name: Delta Electrical Industries Ltd (electrical and electronics)</p>
<p>NOTE - The company said it expected to produce strong earnings growth in 1997.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
